From f89e147d6dd6975dfef5dd42fedae7335e78515e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Veloce PDFium Patches <veloce-pdfium@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 13 Jul 2026 15:51:31 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Veloce: batch exact AGG stroke commands

Replace r25-0069's ineffective disjoint-geometry merge with a bounded command
batch that preserves every PDF path as a separate AGG raster and destination
composite operation. Share only immutable matrix decomposition, renderer, and
scanline setup across adjacent stroke-only commands with identical paint,
matrix, and clip state.

Keep fills, blends, clip changes, state changes, RenderPlan segments, capacity,
and cancellation as hard barriers. Bound each dispatch to 256 paths and 16384
path points. Non-AGG drivers use the exact per-command default implementation.
Remove the duplicate device-bbox work and overlapping-geometry restriction
that produced zero saved dispatches in r25-0069 telemetry.

